{"recordId":"general_司馬望_900971792","name":"司馬望","type":"general","dynasty":"三國","title":"西土磐石","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"司馬望","pageId":583854,"revisionId":91174731,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-01-19T17:30:46Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B8%E9%A6%AC%E6%9C%9B","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91174731","wikidataId":"Q1154734","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"三國志·魏志·元帝紀","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"晋书·卷三·帝纪第三","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"资治通鉴·卷七十九","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"晉書·繆播（從弟胤）傳","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[{"title":"晉書/卷060","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%99%89%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7060","origin":"literal-wikitext-link","retrieved":false}],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:38:05.418Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:sanguozhi","source:songshu","source:jinshu","source:zizhitongjian"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:sanguozhi-9f2de0efe60428f6","query":"司馬望","count":3,"offset":13819,"excerpt":"不亡。伊予小子，曷敢怠荒？庶不忝辱，永奉烝甞。」傅暢《晉諸公贊》曰：帝常與中護軍司馬望、侍中王沈、散騎常侍裴秀、黃門侍郎鍾會等講宴於東堂，并屬文論。名秀為儒林丈人，沈為文籍先生，望、會亦各有名號。帝性急，請召欲速。秀等在內職，到得及時，以望在外，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:sanguozhi-82309c2a1b0d2b26","query":"司馬望","count":1,"offset":4561,"excerpt":"復率數萬人出駱谷，逕至沈嶺。時長城積穀甚多而守兵乃少，聞維方到眾皆惶懼。魏大將軍司馬望拒之，鄧艾亦自隴右，皆軍於長城。維前住芒水，皆倚山為營。望、艾傍渭堅圍，維數下挑戰，望、艾不應。景耀元年，維聞誕破敗，乃還成都。復拜大將軍。\n\n初，先主留魏延鎮","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshu-a2b5140a38e07797","query":"司馬望","count":2,"offset":5038,"excerpt":"，然猶深衣素冠，降席撤膳。太宰司馬孚、太傅鄭沖、太保王祥、太尉何曾、司徒領中領軍司馬望、司空荀顗、車騎將軍賈充、尚書令裴秀、尚書僕射武陔、都護大將軍郭建、侍中郭綏、中書監荀勗、中軍將軍羊祜等奏曰：「臣聞禮典軌度，豐殺隨時，虞、夏、商、周，咸不相襲","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshu-d05dd00d19d81e4f","query":"司馬望","count":1,"offset":4079,"excerpt":"武昌，勞民動眾之應也。\n\n晉武帝泰始七年五月閏月，旱，大雩。是春，孫晧出華里，大司馬望帥眾次于淮北。四月，北地胡寇金城西平，涼州刺史牽弘出戰，敗沒。\n\n泰始八年五月，旱。是時帝納荀勗邪說，留賈充不復西鎮，而任愷稍疏，上下皆蔽之應也。又李憙、魯芝、","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshu-a5b7766b199218fa","query":"司馬望","count":1,"offset":1252,"excerpt":"漢成帝同事。一曰，昔歲及此年，藥蘭泥、白虎文秦涼殺刺史胡烈、牽弘，遣田璋討泥。又司馬望以大眾次淮北禦孫晧。內外兵役，西州饑亂，百姓愁怨，陰氣盛也。咸寧初，始上祖宗號，太熙初，還復五帝位。\n\n晉武帝咸寧元年九月，徐州水；二年七月癸亥，河南魏郡暴水，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:jinshu-8ea2dc21857f82f3","query":"司馬望","count":1,"offset":6077,"excerpt":"太子冠，賜王公以下帛各有差。匈奴帥劉猛叛出塞。\n\n　　三月，孫皓帥眾趨壽陽，遣大司馬望屯淮北以距之。丙戌，〔丙戌　「丙戌」上各本重出「三月」，今刪。〕司空、鉅鹿公裴秀薨。癸巳，以中護軍王業爲尚書左僕射，高陽王珪爲尚書右僕射。孫秀部將何崇帥眾五千人","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:jinshu-63165cbebf16c062","query":"司馬望","count":2,"offset":296,"excerpt":"，然猶深衣素冠，降席撤膳。太宰司馬孚、太傅鄭沖、太保王祥、太尉何曾、司徒領中領軍司馬望、司空荀顗、車騎將軍賈充、尚書令裴秀、尚書僕射武陔、都護大將軍郭建、侍中郭綏、中書監荀勖、中軍將軍羊祜等奏曰：「臣聞禮典軌度，豐殺隨時，虞夏商周，咸不相襲，蓋有","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:jinshu-f33d5eea254d31bf","query":"司馬望","count":1,"offset":477,"excerpt":"命氏，而無忝舊章。世祖武皇帝即位之初，以安平王孚為太宰，鄭沖為太傅，王祥為太保，司馬望為太尉，何曾為司徒，荀顗為司空，石苞為大司馬，陳騫為大將軍，世所謂八公同辰，攀雲附翼者也。若乃成乎棟宇，非一枝之勢；處乎經綸，稱萬夫之敵。或牽羊以葉於夢，或垂釣","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-043c96391a79b6da","query":"司馬望","count":2,"offset":214,"excerpt":"焉。\n\n丙辰，帝幸太學，與諸儒論《書》、《易》及《禮》，諸儒莫能及。帝常與中護軍司馬望、侍中王沈、散騎常侍裴秀、黃門侍郎鐘會等講宴於東堂，並屬文論，特加禮異，謂秀為儒林丈人，沈為文籍先生。帝性急，請召欲速，以望職在外，特給追鋒車、虎賁五人，每有集","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-04e4240eb3047ecb","query":"司馬望","count":1,"offset":294,"excerpt":"國、晉王。\n\n九月，乙未，大赦。\n\n戊子，以魏司徒何曾爲晉丞相；癸亥，以驃騎將軍司馬望爲司徒。\n\n乙亥，葬文王於崇陽陵。\n\n冬，呉西陵督歩闡表請呉主徙都武昌；呉主從之，使御史大夫丁固、右將軍諸葛靚守建業。闡，騭之子也。\n\n十二月，壬戌，魏帝禪位於","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":10,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:sanguozhi-9f2de0efe60428f6","bookId":"book:sanguozhi","requestedTitle":"三國志/卷04","title":"三國志/卷04","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B704","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=8746774","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%BF%97%2F%E5%8D%B704?action=history","revisionId":8746774,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-09-01T00:45:37Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:39:05.976Z","sha256":"b7d193dc3fadd4d04f4fb892ba2e6b308bff1bf2053585f7af296ffc9c4f5bab","textSha256":"2cefd78719d8b34228eb37a1e9212efadbcb5197f593e4c50126a08b83013e0f","expandedWikitextSha256":"b7d193dc3fadd4d04f4fb892ba2e6b308bff1bf2053585f7af296ffc9c4f5bab","characters":23035,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/sanguozhi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:36.536Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/a579c3ce6e7dfa5e367b.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/a579c3ce6e7dfa5e367b.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:sanguozhi-82309c2a1b0d2b26","bookId":"book:sanguozhi","requestedTitle":"三國志/卷44","title":"三國志/卷44","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wik